{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413110","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041311001:1":{"text":"브라이언, 나한테 그 순무콩 수프 주지 마...","source_cn":"布莱恩，不要递给我那份芜菁豆子汤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F31744F58ABAE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041311002:1":{"text":"속일 생각은 말고! 오늘 주방 담당이 순무라고 말한 거 들었으니까!","source_cn":"别想蒙骗我！我亲耳听到今天掌厨的人说那是芜菁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43034FE4FE776044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041311003:1":{"text":"... 소리에 대한 통제력이 좋아지신 것 같군요?","source_cn":"……你对声音的掌控似乎有所提升？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E0408CCE4434CF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041311004:1":{"text":"네 말을 듣고 보니 그런 것 같아! 달빛 그림자가 조용해서 그런가?","source_cn":"这么一说，好像是！也许是因为月影乡足够安静？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F0F437FF7C10114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041311005:1":{"text":"그렇다면 이곳에 은거하면서 능력을 단련하는 게 좋을 것 같은데요?","source_cn":"这么说，你比较适合隐居在这里锻炼自己的能力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE11FC495FFE83362","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041311006:1":{"text":"좋은 생각이야! 청력도 향상하고, 아든 할아버지의 잔소리도 피하고... 좋아, 진지하게 고민해 봐야겠어!","source_cn":"好主意！能提升耳力，还能避开雅顿老爷子的唠叨……不错啊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7079022BBEF7396","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}